Meta.documentation:Number.add
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Adds every Number in the flow together.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Accumulates all incoming Numbers and emits their sum when the input ends.
Meta.documentation:Addition is exact (arbitrary precision).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each Number to add
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the sum, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:1 Number:2 Number:3]>>Number.add:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:6
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.subtract Number.multiply
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
